{"ID":"20240220132612-at36tfx","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132612-at36tfx","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132612-at36tfx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312170343-00besou\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312170258-0xhd41e\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:100,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312170343-syuhn6h\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:115,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:115\u0026#125;","title":"【猪苓汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312170404"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312170343-00besou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170343-00besou","updated":"20240312170343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百四十条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170343-vhw0x65","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170343-vhw0x65","updated":"20240312170343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「阳明病」，心中懊憹，舌上胎者，宜「栀子豉汤」主之。若渴欲饮水，口干舌燥者，「白虎加人参汤」主之。若脉浮发热，渴欲饮水，小便不利者，「猪苓汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170343-98r90w3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170343-98r90w3","updated":"20240312170343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“心中懊憹，”胃里面很难过"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。栀子专门去上焦的虚热。渴欲饮水，口干舌燥，白虎加人参汤。渴欲饮水，小便不利者，猪苓汤。临床上的时候猪苓汤很好用。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170343-s4upy2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170343-s4upy2a","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312170343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"猪苓汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312170343-f7dqig5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170343-f7dqig5","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312170343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"猪苓一两去皮。茯苓一两。阿胶一两。滑石一两碎。泽泻一两。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312170343-3v65jwr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170343-3v65jwr","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312170343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右五味，以水四升，先煮四味，取二升，去滓，纳下阿胶烊消，温服七合，日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312170343-fa861au","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170343-fa861au","updated":"20240312170343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"都是一两，等量。阿胶、白术换成桂枝、白术，正是我们的五苓散。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"猪苓汤出现的时候，一定小便痛，膀胱炎或者是尿道结石，肾结石的时候，会用到猪苓汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170343-s4kel92","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170343-s4kel92","updated":"20240312170343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"滑石，按照本草也是攻坚的，把石头打烂通利出来。在通利的时候，从肾脏到膀胱，中间还有输尿管，那个石头很锋利，会把尿道刮破，小便就带血，痛。阿胶放里面，阿胶止血。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以你看这个猪苓汤设计的多好，滑石把结石打下来，阿胶进行止血；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓能利中焦的水，猪苓能利下焦的水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"泽泻是上焦。全身水都往下走"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，把全身的水集中下来，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用滑石打下来再用阿胶止血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个方子根本就是肾结石，膀胱结石在用的。结石以外，只要病人出现"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"渴欲饮水，小便不利，统统可以用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。五苓散小便不利也可以用，可是五苓散用在时疫，经方有发表的药，你开发表的药，剂量不够，汗发出去的时候，肠胃的病邪本来该发到皮肤表面上发出去的，结果你开的剂量不够，一部分出了表面了，一部分停在肌肉皮肤中间，五苓散是收表水，表面的水没有透发的时候，五苓散把它收集起来小便排掉，猪苓汤直接攻下。五苓散有桂枝，就是强心阳，希望能够解肌，把药带到皮肤表面上。白术收敛它的湿。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170343-b0scvvm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170343-b0scvvm","updated":"20240312170343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"猪苓汤，四碗水煮成两碗。再放阿胶。服七合就是，一碗你喝七分就好了，不用全部喝掉。阿胶如果说是一钱，四碗煮两碗，一碗只有半钱的阿胶。这个是原来的方剂。如果有病人跑来，肚子痛的要死，不知道是肾结石还是大便堵到，所以介绍针灸的时候就讲，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果遇到结石的时候，在脚的内踝落，太溪穴到复溜穴会找到结石的压痛点"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，结石痛的时候非常的痛。如果懂针灸，用手压到痛点，针扎到痛点的时候，痛就去掉，病人会感觉石头在动，一直在移动，这都是我临床的经历。药房煮猪苓汤再攻，有时候用药丸丸剂也可以。急的时候汤剂，不急的时候丸剂就可以。阿胶烊尽的时候，病人排尿石头下来，病人一滴血都没有，厉不厉害。这是绝对处方，绝对比例，大家要对中医有信心，除非你乱用。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170343-n8vbara","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170343-n8vbara","updated":"20240312170343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有些外国人煮药把汤倒了，把渣吃了，我不晓得他怎么吃下去的，反正他就吃完啦，还跟我抱怨很难吃，然后我说你喝汤才对啊，她说我先生说我一定弄错了，她心里想我先生也没来，他怎么知道？所以我就不听我先生的，（所以喝汤吃渣），最后我说我错了，我再给你一副免费的好了（笑）。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170343-syuhn6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170343-syuhn6h","updated":"20240312170404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五苓散和猪苓汤不一样的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"五苓散要大剂的利尿，所以重用泽泻。猪苓汤剂量统统一样"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。肾结石，膀胱结石都可以用，当然可以啦，肾与膀胱相表里嘛。病人只要小便滴滴答答不通，就可以用。小便痛排不出来，里面是石，或者是尿道炎，或者是淋病，无所谓，攻。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170344-t69j7jk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170344-t69j7jk"}},{"ID":"20240312170328-kq1twja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170328-kq1twja","updated":"20240312170328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百四十一条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170328-k16x9hp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170328-k16x9hp","updated":"20240312170328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「阳明病」，汗出多而渴者，不可与「猪苓汤」，以汗多胃中燥，「猪苓汤」复利其小便故也。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170328-jvh25az","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170328-jvh25az","updated":"20240312170328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是一个原则，如果真有小便不利，是因为堵到东西的话，你要用猪苓汤，把它清出来，我们叫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"急下存阴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的方式，而不是滋阴的方式。这里确定"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人津液很伤的时候，不要再给他猪苓汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为猪苓汤会把小便利出来。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170329-2b03482","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170329-2b03482"}},{"ID":"20240312170258-hpbu5mt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170258-hpbu5mt","updated":"20240312170258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百三十三条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170258-eb6tvuj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170258-eb6tvuj","updated":"20240312170258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「少阴病」，下利六七日，小便不利，咳而呕，渴，心烦不得眠者，「猪苓汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170258-icsoggd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170258-icsoggd","updated":"20240312170258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"照理说“下利六七日”应该脱水了，造成小便不利。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170258-65ok9wv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170258-65ok9wv","updated":"20240312170258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"‘咳而呕，渴，心烦不得眠者，「猪苓汤」主之’，「猪苓汤」本来是去水热，有水积在里面，有热，热就是发炎。里面小便石头堵到了。照理说下痢以后病人应该是津液不够了，应该补津液。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170258-fr4obgg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170258-fr4obgg","updated":"20240312170258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“渴”有热才会渴，寒症没有渴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170258-etnd72o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170258-etnd72o","updated":"20240312170258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“心烦不得眠者”肾结石堵到了，当然烦躁了，身体里面不舒服有痛。这种都是猪苓汤。是水热并结。照理说热不会累积东西，寒才会累积，所谓热就是东西堵到了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170258-2iea2ro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170258-2iea2ro","updated":"20240312170258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7——6"}]},{"ID":"20240312170258-0xhd41e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170258-0xhd41e","updated":"20240312170258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大家只要知道猪苓汤的功能，一般是石头沙堵到，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"真正很大的石头堵到的时候，猪苓汤还不够力。金匮还有方子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]}]}